pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 36, 500, 16]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      wrap: false
      text: 痛点 01 · 认知差距
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 56, 832, 32]
    content:
      style: "$h1"
      wrap: false
      text: 认知差距：用三层映射资料把「业务口径」翻译成「技术实体」
  - elementId: title-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 96, 44, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$accent"}
  - elementId: prob-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 122, 300, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      bold: true
      color: "$accent"
      wrap: false
      text: 问题表现
  - elementId: prob-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 144, 300, 110]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 12
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>· 业务术语与技术字段各说各话，同一个词两种理解</p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px">· 口径靠口口相传，人一走就断层</p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px">· 算法反复确认口径，需求还没做就耗掉一周</p>
  - elementId: rule-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 276, 300, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      bold: true
      color: "$primary"
      wrap: false
      text: 维护约定（写进模板）
  - elementId: rule-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 298, 300, 130]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 12
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>1. 立项时业务方先更新映射，算法方确认「技术映射」列</p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px">2. 口径变更必须改文档并 @ 双 owner，禁止只在群里同步</p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px">3. 每季度 review 通用层，沉淀跨业务可复用条目</p>
  - elementId: layer1-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [404, 128, 3, 64]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: layer1-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [407, 128, 489, 64]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$panel"}
  - elementId: layer1-t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [424, 128, 456, 64]
    content:
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:13px; color:$ink;"><strong>通用层</strong></span><span style="font-size:11px; color:$faint;">　跨业务复用</span></p>
        <p style="margin-top:4px"><span style="font-size:11px; color:#3A423C;">公司统一口径：用户 / 订单 / 支付……与全公司数据字典对齐，季度 review</span></p>
  - elementId: layer-arr1
    elementType: line
    bounds: [640, 196, 4, 18]
    viewBox: [4, 18]
    points: "2,0 2,18"
    curve: sharp
    arrow: [null, "arrow"]
    border: {style: solid, width: 1.5, color: "$gray"}
  - elementId: layer2-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [404, 218, 3, 64]
